{%- comment -%}
 ── Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 BITC_BLOG handle of the blog that carries the series. Used when the page is not
 a blog template (the hub is a normal page and has no `blog` object).
 The live store's general blog is `novinky`; the series gets its own blog
 because a Liquid loop over `blog.articles` stops at the newest 50, and
 Novinky already holds ~25 material entries and keeps growing — chapter
 articles would eventually fall out of the hub's reach.
 BITC_SERIES series tag, used only when the series shares a blog with other content.
 Leave empty when the series has its own blog (the recommended setup).
 CH_TAGS chapter tags, in order. An article belongs to a chapter by carrying its
 tag; a chapter with no published article renders as "coming soon".
 CH_NAMES chapter names. Proper names and product lines stay in English in every
 market (Katka, Peak Flow); only the subtitles are translated (t_chNsub).
 PER cards per page in the archive grid.
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign BITC_BLOG = 'novinky' -%}
{%- assign BITC_SERIES = '' -%}
{%- assign BITC_HUB = '/pages/born-in-the-carpathians' -%}
{%- assign CH_TAGS = 'chapter-01,chapter-02,chapter-03,chapter-04' -%}
{%- assign CH_NAMES = 'Katka & Shoes|David & Peak Flow|Skialp|Backpacks' -%}
{%- assign PER = 12 -%}
{%- comment -%}
 `blog` exists on a blog template. On the hub page it is nil, so the handle is read
 from the path — the segment after /blogs/, which survives a locale prefix like /de/ —
 and only then does it fall back to BITC_BLOG.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bitc_blog = blog -%}
{%- if bitc_blog == blank -%}
 {%- assign bitc_bh = request.path | split: '/blogs/' | last | split: '/' | first -%}
 {%- if blogs[bitc_bh] != blank -%}{%- assign bitc_blog = blogs[bitc_bh] -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if bitc_blog == blank -%}{%- assign bitc_blog = blogs[BITC_BLOG] -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
 Where the series shares a blog, the archive lives at the series tag URL and every
 "all articles" link has to keep that filter on.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bitc_all_url = bitc_blog.url -%}
{%- assign bitc_tag_prefix = bitc_blog.url | append: '/tagged/' -%}
{%- if BITC_SERIES != blank -%}
 {%- assign bitc_all_url = bitc_blog.url | append: '/tagged/' | append: BITC_SERIES -%}
 {%- assign bitc_tag_prefix = bitc_all_url | append: '+' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
 The series tag is the floor of this view, not a filter on it — so it never counts as
 the active topic and never shows up as one of the pills.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bitc_tag = blank -%}
{%- for tg in current_tags -%}
 {%- assign tgh = tg | handle -%}
 {%- if tgh != BITC_SERIES -%}{%- assign bitc_tag = tg -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign bitc_tagh = bitc_tag | handle -%}
{%- comment -%}
 Hidden when a chapter or topic filter is on: a filtered view should be one honest
 list, not a fixed band of newest posts with a filtered grid under it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bitc_n = bitc_blog.articles_count | default: 0 -%}
{%- if bitc_tag == blank and bitc_n > 1 -%}
